        "original_id": "5b483ff3-9600-5a36-9aba-75b335c5d6a1",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Hengqin Island, Zhuhai\n- Organizations: University of Macau, Chimelong Group\n- Products: Chimelong International Ocean Tourist Resort, Lotus Bridge\n- Topics: land lease, tourism\n\nFacts:\n- Hengqin Island is an island associated with Zhuhai.\n- Parts of Hengqin Island are leased to the University of Macau for its campus.\n- Zhuhai is the city connected to Hengqin Island by the Lotus Bridge.\n- Chimelong Group operates the Chimelong International Ocean Tourist Resort on Hengqin Island.\n- The Chimelong International Ocean Tourist Resort on Hengqin Island is a five-star resort.",
