        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "6ccfc396-6bba-5291-934c-663d033dde2b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Lotus Bridge, Cotai, Macau, Hengqin Island, Zhuhai, Guangdong, China\n- Organizations: State Council of the People's Republic of China, Clube de Natação Hoi Fan\n- Products: Chimelong International Ocean Resort\n- Topics: Cross-border transport, Macau-mainland China connections\n\nFacts:\n- Lotus Bridge is a cross-border bridge linking the Cotai reclamation area of Macau with Hengqin Island in Zhuhai, Guangdong, China.\n- Lotus Bridge is the road crossing between mainland China and Macau.\n- Hengqin, also known in Portuguese as Ilha de Montanha, is an island in Zhuhai, a prefecture-level city and Special Economic Zone in Guangdong, China.\n- In 2009, the State Council of the People's Republic of China leased parts of Hengqin to Macau.\n- Chimelong International Ocean Resort is located in Hengqin, Zhuhai, China.\n- Clube de Natação Hoi Fan is a Macau football club that plays in the town of Macau.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
